3. No clinical use
   ORCA-MI is a research tool. It is not a medical device: it has no CE
   marking and no FDA clearance. It must not be used for diagnosis,
   treatment, treatment planning or any other clinical decision about a
   patient. All measurements, segmentations, dose estimates and AI results
   must be checked by a qualified person.

4. Citation
   If you use ORCA-MI in work that leads to a publication, presentation or
   report, please cite it as described in CITATION.cff in this repository.

5. Third-party components
   ORCA-MI contains open-source libraries that remain under their own
